      "problem": "Find $\\lim_\\limits{x\\rightarrow \\,-1}f(x)$ for the function $f(x)$ whose graph is shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14198813/assets/eead78a813f820cf12cbd05bd22b230b1753c7e4ebe1e77d2c1eb6b61c11f4ed.png)",
